⍝ Runs every test suite: the chess suites in APLSource/Tests/*Tests.apln
⍝ and the test framework's own suites in
⍝ APLSource/Tests/Framework/*Tests.apln.
⍝
⍝ Usage: dyalogscript run-tests.apls
⍝
⍝ Exits with code 1 if a file fails to load, or any test fails or errors.
⍝
⍝ Files are fixed into the namespaces Link creates when APLSource is
⍝ linked into #: #.DeepOrange, #.Tests and #.Tests.Framework.

⎕IO ⎕ML←1

findFiles←{{⍵[⍋⍵]}⊆⊃0(⎕NINFO⍠1)⍵}

SOURCE_TYPES←'.apln' '.aplc' '.apli' '.aplf' '.aplo'
isSourceFile←{(⊂3⊃1 ⎕NPARTS ⍵)∊SOURCE_TYPES}

fail←{⍬⊣⍞←'LOAD  ',⍺,': ',⍵,⎕UCS 10}

loadFile←{
    ⍝ ⍺ ←→ target namespace
    ⍝ ⍵ ←→ path of a file defining a single namespace
    ⍝ ← ←→ reference to the namespace, or ⍬ when the file fails to load
    0::⍵ fail⊃⎕DMX.DM
    ⍺.⎕FIX'file://',⍵
}

args←2 ⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'
source_dir←(⊃1 ⎕NPARTS⊃args),'APLSource/'
engine_dir←source_dir,'DeepOrange/'
test_dir←source_dir,'Tests/'
framework_dir←test_dir,'Framework/'

'DeepOrange' 'Tests'⎕NS¨⊂⍬
'Tests.Framework'⎕NS⍬

⍝ Suites are loaded before everything else, so a suite that uses another
⍝ namespace while it is being fixed fails here, whatever order Link or
⍝ a session would load the files in. Such an error is reported but
⍝ leaves the suite incomplete, so its tests then fail.
⍝ The suites are fixed in a :Trap at script level: an error in a
⍝ multi-line dfn called during the fix escapes a dfn error guard and
⍝ leaves the script running inside the suite.
suites←⍬
chess_suites←findFiles test_dir,'*Tests.apln'
framework_suites←findFiles framework_dir,'*Tests.apln'
suite_paths←chess_suites,framework_suites
suite_targets←((≢chess_suites)⍴Tests),(≢framework_suites)⍴Tests.Framework
:For path target :InEach suite_paths suite_targets
    :Trap 0
        suites,←target.⎕FIX'file://',path
    :Else
        _←path fail⊃⎕DMX.DM
        suites,←⊂⍬
    :EndTrap
:EndFor

paths←findFiles engine_dir,'*'
sources←DeepOrange loadFile¨(isSourceFile¨paths)/paths
support←Tests.Framework loadFile¨framework_dir∘,¨'Tester.apln' 'Assert.apln'
support,←Tests loadFile¨⊂test_dir,'Helpers.apln'
failed←∨/0=≢¨sources,support,suites

:if ~failed
    suites←(0≠≢¨suites)/suites
    results←Tests.Framework.Tester.run suites
    failed∨←Tests.Framework.Tester.failed results
:endIf

⎕OFF(failed)
